      "@type": "bootstrap:Role",
      "label": "Site Publisher",
      "description": "Renders a Knowledge Graph — the whole of it, or a list of its Subgraphs — for GitHub Pages at a publication root URL, has it deployed, checks what is served, and reports the push's status with one message. Performed by an agent running these tools, or by a Pages workflow running the same commands; the steps and the report are the same either way. It does not decide WHICH root URL or WHICH Subgraphs: whoever started the process says, and a staging root and a release root are the same process with a different answer.",
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/scenarios/roles.json",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/directory/bootstrap-tools-scenarios",
